<title>CYPRUS: PRESS DIGEST - Cyprus - Oct 2.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Cyprus - Oct 2.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owing to printers' holidays on the occasion of Cyprus's Independence Day no Greek-language newspapers were issued on October 1 and none on October 2.</p>
</text>
